Description: K-centers functional clustering (KCFC) and robust K-centers
    functional clustering (RKCFC) for sparsely and irregularly observed
    univariate longitudinal data that may be non-Gaussian. RKCFC replaces the
    conventional functional principal component analysis inside the K-centers
    iteration with Kendall's tau functional principal component analysis, whose
    eigenspace agrees with that of the covariance operator without a moment
    assumption on the principal component scores. The package also carries the
    metrics and data-generating functions used by the accompanying manuscript;
    the study scripts that call them are distributed separately
    <https://github.com/BingbingFan/RKCFC_Simulation>.
    Includes an internal KFPCA-derived implementation based on KFPCA version 2.0
    by Rou Zhong and Jingxiao Zhang <https://github.com/BingbingFan/KFPCA>,
    incorporated under GPL (>= 3). RKCFC-specific adaptations are by Bingbing Fan
    and are identified in the source.
URL: https://github.com/BingbingFan/RKCFC
